# --- PII containment (see reports/code-review/pii-tracked-inventory.json) ---
# raw report intermediates carry employee names from Superset object titles;
# only masked copies under reports/public/** may be published
reports/phase-01-9/_*.txt
reports/phase-01-9/*_findings.json
reports/public/**/*.raw.md
